id: SHELL7-1
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: step_body_host
target: crates/web/src/step_body.rs
find:         body: select_body(node, level).map(|b| (b.level, b.doc)),
replace:         body: select_body(node, GuidanceLevel::A).map(|b| (b.level, b.doc)),
expect-fail: 案内レベルに応じた本文と_do_が出て欠けた水準は濃い側へ倒れる
note: 本文の選択に常に A を渡す（案内レベル別の本文。SHELL-7・TASK-525）
